      "offsetInSection": 2484,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00160000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "WOUAH ! J’ai adoré voir Méga-Hexadron\net Méga-Lugulabre en action !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƒ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 2496,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0057004F005500410048002000210020004A201900610069002000610064006F007200E900200076006F006900720020004D00E900670061002D004800650078006100640072006F006E000A006500740020004D00E900670061002D004C007500670075006C006100620072006500200065006E00200061006300740069006F006E0020002100100002011401920000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 72
    },
    {
      "displayText": "La Méga-Évolution AURAIT DÛ nous permettre\nde réduire nos adversaires en poussière...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0011>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 2640,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 90
    },
    {
      "displayText": "J’avoue qu’une fois méga-évolués, les Pokémon\ngagnent un max de puissance !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƒ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 2820,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 80
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Mais pour permettre à un Pokémon d’exprimer\ntout son potentiel, son Dresseur doit connaître<U+0010><U+0001>븀\ntoutes les ficelles de la Méga-Évolution !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƒ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 2980,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 142
    },
    {
      "displayText": "ENTENDU !\nJe vais poursuivre mon entraînement !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0011>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 3264,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0045004E00540045004E0044005500200021000A004A00650020007600610069007300200070006F007500720073007500690076007200650020006D006F006E00200065006E00740072006100EE006E0065006D0065006E00740020002100100002011400110000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 52
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Cette Cornélia est redoutable... Comment a-t-elle\nfait pour rendre mon frère aussi docile ?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0012>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 3368,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 96
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Notre combat m’a ému ! Tenez, acceptez cette\ntenue en témoignage de ma profonde admiration !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0011>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 3560,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 97
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Oh, c’est gentil ! Mais j’ai déjà tellement\nde responsabilités...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƒ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 3756,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004F0068002C002000632019006500730074002000670065006E00740069006C002000210020004D0061006900730020006A2019006100690020006400E9006A00E0002000740065006C006C0065006D0065006E0074000A0064006500200072006500730070006F006E0073006100620069006C0069007400E90073002E002E002E00100002011401920000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 70
    },
    {
      "displayText": "J’suis la Championne de l’Arène de Yantreizh,\nl’Héritière de la Méga-Évolution, et maintenant,<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nje fais partie de la Team MZ !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƒ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 31,
      "offsetInSection": 3896,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 133
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Déjà que j’ai arrêté de faire du roller, si en plus\nje porte l’uniforme des Poings de la Justice,<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nles gens vont plus rien comprendre !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƒ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 32,
      "offsetInSection": 4164,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 142
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Entendu ! Je vais donc l’offrir à <U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0011>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 33,
      "offsetInSection": 4448,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0045006E00740065006E00640075002000210020004A00650020007600610069007300200064006F006E00630020006C2019006F00660066007200690072002000E000200010000201000000002E00100002011400110000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 44
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Vous obtenez le kimono de Nivis !",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 34,
      "offsetInSection": 4536,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0056006F007500730020006F006200740065006E0065007A0020006C00650020006B0069006D006F006E006F0020006400650020004E0069007600690073002000210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 34
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Pas la peine d’insister autant...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0012>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 35,
      "offsetInSection": 4604,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0050006100730020006C00610020007000650069006E00650020006420190069006E00730069007300740065007200200061007500740061006E0074002E002E002E00100002011400120000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 38
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Un jour, mon entraînement me permettra de\ndevenir un MÉGA-DRESSEUR !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0011>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 36,
      "offsetInSection": 4680,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0055006E0020006A006F00750072002C0020006D006F006E00200065006E00740072006100EE006E0065006D0065006E00740020006D00650020007000650072006D00650074007400720061002000640065000A0064006500760065006E0069007200200075006E0020004D00C900470041002D004400520045005300530045005500520020002100100002011400110000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 73
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ce lieu... Serait-ce l’endroit dissimulé aux yeux\ndu monde que je cherche ?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0012>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 37,
      "offsetInSection": 4828,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 80
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Un grand pouvoir implique de grandes\nsouffrances...<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nPour les surmonter, on doit renforcer\nnos liens avec nos Pokémon !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƒ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 38,
